        {
          "id": "SP_PARVIPLANA_JERONIMOI_P_REZ_GARC_A_NORE_A_CERVERA_2018",
          "name": "Parviplana jeronimoi Pérez-García, Noreña & Cervera, 2018",
          "rank": "SPECIES",
          "commonName": "",
          "lineage": "Parviplana",
          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "Parviplana species with elongated body shapes, dorsal background colour yellow-brown, ventrally pale yellow. Paired cerebral and tentacular eyes. Genital pores separated. Male apparatus with a true seminal vesicle, interpolated and bulb-shaped prostatic vesicle, and massive penis papilla, while the female system shows a vagina bulbosa and a well-developed Lang’s vesicle (for more details, see Pérez-García et al. 2019).",
